{"title_zh":"我的中国朋友","subtitle_zh":"你教我，我教你","title_en":"My Chinese Friend","subtitle_en":"You teach me, I teach you","author":"Text and translation by Claude (Anthropic)","type":"meta"}
{"type":"p","id":"intro","segs":[{"en":"Anna is French. She is twenty this year.","tok":[["安娜","Ānnà","Anna","N"],["是","shì"],["法国","Fǎguó","France","N"],["人","rén"],"，",["今年","jīnnián"],["二十","èrshí"],["岁","suì"],"。"]},{"en":"She is studying Chinese at a university in Beijing.","tok":[["她","tā"],["在","zài"],["北京","Běijīng"],["的","de"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["大学","dàxué"],["学习","xuéxí"],["汉语","Hànyǔ"],"。"]},{"en":"She can speak a little Chinese, and she can write some characters too.","tok":[["她","tā"],["会","huì"],["说","shuō"],["一点儿","yīdiǎnr"],["汉语","Hànyǔ"],"，",["也","yě"],["会","huì"],["写","xiě"],["一些","yīxiē"],["汉字","Hànzì"],"。"]},{"en":"She likes Beijing very much. She has lots of foreign friends, but no Chinese friends yet.","tok":[["她","tā"],["很","hěn"],["喜欢","xǐhuan"],["北京","Běijīng"],"。",["她","tā"],["有","yǒu"],["很","hěn"],["多","duō"],["外国","wàiguó"],["朋友","péngyou"],"，",["还","hái"],["没有","méiyǒu"],["中国","Zhōngguó"],["朋友","péngyou"],"。"]}],"zh":"安娜是法国人，今年二十岁。她在北京的一个大学学习汉语。她会说一点儿汉语，也会写一些汉字。她很喜欢北京。她有很多外国朋友，还没有中国朋友。"}
{"type":"h2","id":"h-new","segs":[{"en":"A New Friend","tok":[["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["新","xīn"],["朋友","péngyou"]]}],"zh":"一个新朋友"}
{"type":"p","id":"new-1","segs":[{"en":"On Wednesday afternoon Anna was reading in the library.","tok":[["星期三","xīngqīsān"],["下午","xiàwǔ"],"，",["安娜","Ānnà","Anna","N"],["在","zài"],["图书馆","túshūguǎn"],["看书","kànshū"],"。"]},{"en":"There was a character in her book that she didn't know.","tok":[["书","shū"],["里","lǐ"],["有","yǒu"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["字","zì"],"，",["她","tā"],["不","bù"],["认识","rènshi"],"。"]},{"en":"A young man was sitting next to her.","tok":[["她","tā"],["旁边","pángbiān"],["坐","zuò"],["着","zhe"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["男生","nánshēng"],"。"]},{"en":"Anna asked him, “Excuse me, how do you read this character?”","tok":[["安娜","Ānnà","Anna","N"],["问","wèn"],["他","tā"],"：","“",["对不起","duìbuqǐ"],"，",["请问","qǐngwèn"],"，",["这个","zhège"],["字","zì"],["怎么","zěnme"],["读","dú"],"？","”"]},{"en":"He took a look and said, “That's fēi, as in fēijī, ‘aeroplane’.”","tok":[["男生","nánshēng"],["看","kàn"],["了","le"],["看","kàn"],"，",["说","shuō"],"：","“",["这","zhè"],["是","shì"],"‘",["飞","fēi"],"’","，",["飞机","fēijī"],["的","de"],"‘",["飞","fēi"],"’","。","”"]}],"zh":"星期三下午，安娜在图书馆看书。书里有一个字，她不认识。她旁边坐着一个男生。安娜问他：“对不起，请问，这个字怎么读？”男生看了看，说：“这是‘飞’，飞机的‘飞’。”"}
{"type":"p","id":"new-2","segs":[{"en":"“Thank you! Are you a student here?”","tok":["“",["谢谢","xièxie"],"！",["你","nǐ"],["是","shì"],["这儿","zhèr"],["的","de"],["学生","xuésheng"],["吗","ma"],"？","”"]},{"en":"“Yes. I'm Li Ming, and I'm from Beijing. What about you?”","tok":["“",["是","shì"],"。",["我","wǒ"],["叫","jiào"],["李明","Lǐ Míng","Li Ming","N"],"，",["我","wǒ"],["是","shì"],["北京","Běijīng"],["人","rén"],"。",["你","nǐ"],["呢","ne"],"？","”"]},{"en":"“I'm Anna. I'm French.”","tok":["“",["我","wǒ"],["叫","jiào"],["安娜","Ānnà","Anna","N"],"，",["我","wǒ"],["是","shì"],["法国","Fǎguó","France","N"],["人","rén"],"。","”"]},{"en":"Li Ming looked delighted. “Do you speak French?”","tok":[["李明","Lǐ Míng","Li Ming","N"],["很","hěn"],["高兴","gāoxìng"],"：","“",["你","nǐ"],["会","huì"],["说","shuō"],["法语","Fǎyǔ","French (language)","N"],["吗","ma"],"？","”"]},{"en":"Anna laughed. “I'm French, so yes, I speak French!”","tok":[["安娜","Ānnà","Anna","N"],["笑","xiào"],["了","le"],"：","“",["我","wǒ"],["是","shì"],["法国","Fǎguó","France","N"],["人","rén"],"，",["我","wǒ"],["会","huì"],["说","shuō"],["法语","Fǎyǔ","French (language)","N"],"！","”"]}],"zh":"“谢谢！你是这儿的学生吗？”“是。我叫李明，我是北京人。你呢？”“我叫安娜，我是法国人。”李明很高兴：“你会说法语吗？”安娜笑了：“我是法国人，我会说法语！”"}
{"type":"p","id":"new-3","segs":[{"en":"“I'd really like to learn French,” said Li Ming. “Could you teach me?”","tok":[["李明","Lǐ Míng","Li Ming","N"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["我","wǒ"],["很","hěn"],["想","xiǎng"],["学","xué"],["法语","Fǎyǔ","French (language)","N"],"。",["你","nǐ"],["能","néng"],["教","jiāo"],["我","wǒ"],["吗","ma"],"？","”"]},{"en":"Anna thought for a moment and said, “Yes. And could you teach me Chinese too?”","tok":[["安娜","Ānnà","Anna","N"],["想","xiǎng"],["了","le"],["想","xiǎng"],"，",["说","shuō"],"：","“",["能","néng"],"。",["你","nǐ"],["也","yě"],["能","néng"],["教","jiāo"],["我","wǒ"],["汉语","Hànyǔ"],["吗","ma"],"？","”"]},{"en":"“Yes! That's great!”","tok":["“",["能","néng"],"！",["太","tài"],["好","hǎo"],["了","le"],"！","”"]},{"en":"They agreed to meet at the library every Monday, Wednesday and Friday afternoon.","tok":[["他们","tāmen"],["说","shuō"],["好","hǎo"],"，",["星期一","xīngqīyī"],"、",["星期三","xīngqīsān"],"、",["星期五","xīngqīwǔ"],["的","de"],["下午","xiàwǔ"],"，",["都","dōu"],["在","zài"],["图书馆","túshūguǎn"],["见面","jiànmiàn"],"。"]}],"zh":"李明说：“我很想学法语。你能教我吗？”安娜想了想，说：“能。你也能教我汉语吗？”“能！太好了！”他们说好，星期一、星期三、星期五的下午，都在图书馆见面。"}
{"type":"h2","id":"h-can","segs":[{"en":"Can You Say It?","tok":[["你","nǐ"],["会","huì"],["说","shuō"],["吗","ma"],"？"]}],"zh":"你会说吗？"}
{"type":"p","id":"can-1","segs":[{"en":"At their first lesson, Li Ming bought Anna a cup of tea.","tok":[["第一","dìyī"],["次","cì"],["上课","shàngkè"],"，",["李明","Lǐ Míng","Li Ming","N"],["给","gěi"],["安娜","Ānnà","Anna","N"],["买","mǎi"],["了","le"],["一","yī"],["杯","bēi"],["茶","chá"],"。"]},{"en":"“This is chá, tea. Can you say it?”","tok":["“",["这","zhè"],["是","shì"],["茶","chá"],"。",["你","nǐ"],["会","huì"],["说","shuō"],["吗","ma"],"？","”"]},{"en":"“Chá,” said Anna.","tok":["“",["茶","chá"],"。","”",["安娜","Ānnà","Anna","N"],["说","shuō"],"。"]},{"en":"“Very good!” said Li Ming.","tok":["“",["很","hěn"],["好","hǎo"],"！","”",["李明","Lǐ Míng","Li Ming","N"],["说","shuō"],"。"]},{"en":"“And how do you say ‘tea’ in French?”","tok":["“",["茶","chá"],"，",["法语","Fǎyǔ","French (language)","N"],["怎么","zěnme"],["说","shuō"],"？","”"]},{"en":"Anna said it once. Li Ming said it three times, and got it wrong every time.","tok":[["安娜","Ānnà","Anna","N"],["说","shuō"],["了","le"],["一","yī"],["次","cì"],"。",["李明","Lǐ Míng","Li Ming","N"],["说","shuō"],["了","le"],["三","sān"],["次","cì"],"，",["都","dōu"],["不","bù"],["对","duì"],"。"]},{"en":"They both laughed.","tok":[["他们","tāmen"],["两","liǎng"],["个","gè"],["人","rén"],["都","dōu"],["笑","xiào"],["了","le"],"。"]}],"zh":"第一次上课，李明给安娜买了一杯茶。“这是茶。你会说吗？”“茶。”安娜说。“很好！”李明说。“茶，法语怎么说？”安娜说了一次。李明说了三次，都不对。他们两个人都笑了。"}
{"type":"p","id":"can-2","segs":[{"en":"From that day on they often studied together.","tok":[["从","cóng"],["那","nà"],["天","tiān"],["起","qǐ"],"，",["他们","tāmen"],["常常","chángcháng"],["一起","yīqǐ"],["学习","xuéxí"],"。"]},{"en":"Anna worked hard and wrote characters every day.","tok":[["安娜","Ānnà","Anna","N"],["很","hěn"],["认真","rènzhēn"],"，",["天天","tiāntiān"],["写","xiě"],["汉字","Hànzì"],"。"]},{"en":"Li Ming worked hard too. He listened to French on his way to school, and on the bus as well.","tok":[["李明","Lǐ Míng","Li Ming","N"],["也","yě"],["很","hěn"],["认真","rènzhēn"],"，",["在","zài"],["路上","lùshang"],["听","tīng"],["法语","Fǎyǔ","French (language)","N"],"，",["在","zài"],["车上","chēshang"],["也","yě"],["听","tīng"],["法语","Fǎyǔ","French (language)","N"],"。"]}],"zh":"从那天起，他们常常一起学习。安娜很认真，天天写汉字。李明也很认真，在路上听法语，在车上也听法语。"}
{"type":"p","id":"can-3","segs":[{"en":"Sometimes Li Ming would ask, “Are you tired?”","tok":[["有时候","yǒushíhou"],"，",["李明","Lǐ Míng","Li Ming","N"],["问","wèn"],"：","“",["你","nǐ"],["累","lèi"],["吗","ma"],"？","”"]},{"en":"“No,” Anna would say. “Are you?”","tok":[["安娜","Ānnà","Anna","N"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["不","bù"],["累","lèi"],"。",["你","nǐ"],["呢","ne"],"？","”"]},{"en":"“I'm not tired either. French is hard, and it's beautiful too.”","tok":["“",["我","wǒ"],["也","yě"],["不","bù"],["累","lèi"],"。",["法语","Fǎyǔ","French (language)","N"],["很","hěn"],["难","nán"],"，",["也","yě"],["很","hěn"],["好听","hǎotīng"],"。","”"]},{"en":"“Chinese is hard too, and beautiful too.”","tok":["“",["汉语","Hànyǔ"],["也","yě"],["很","hěn"],["难","nán"],"，",["也","yě"],["很","hěn"],["好听","hǎotīng"],"。","”"]}],"zh":"有时候，李明问：“你累吗？”安娜说：“不累。你呢？”“我也不累。法语很难，也很好听。”“汉语也很难，也很好听。”"}
